📬 Delivery Semantics (Interview Favorite)

| Semantic            | Meaning                                      | Typical how                                      |
| ------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| At-most-once        | Message may be lost, never duplicated        | Commit offset before processing                  |
| At-least-once       | Message never lost, may duplicate            | Process then commit offset (default mindset)     |
| Exactly-once (EOS)  | Effectively once (harder)                    | Idempotent producer + transactions (complex)     |

In practice for many apps:
Use at-least-once + make consumers **idempotent** (safe if same event arrives twice).


